# Testes rápidos da API — extensão "REST Client" do VS Code (Send Request acima de cada bloco)
@base = http://localhost:3000/api

### Saúde
GET {{base}}/health

### Login (admin do seed)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "registration": 10001, "password": "Semurb@123" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Meu perfil
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Funcionários do setor
GET {{base}}/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cadastrar funcionário
POST {{base}}/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "registration": 20002, "name": "Novo Fiscal", "email": "novo@semurb.dev", "phone": "11999990010", "teamId": 2 }

### Definir escala 5x2 com folga sábado/domingo
PUT {{base}}/employees/20001/scale
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startDate": "2026-10-01", "scaleType": "5x2", "weeklyDaysOff": ["Sab", "Dom"] }

### Definir turno
PUT {{base}}/employees/20001/shift
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "shiftStart": "08:00", "shiftEnd": "17:00", "shiftPause": "01:00" }

### Registrar dia específico
POST {{base}}/employees/20001/occasions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "day": "2026-10-20", "type": "Atestado", "description": "Consulta" }

### Quem trabalha no dia
GET {{base}}/employees/on-duty?date=2026-10-12
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Calendário do mês de um funcionário
GET {{base}}/employees/20001/schedule?year=2026&month=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Relatório do setor (PDF)
GET {{base}}/reports/sector?year=2026&month=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
